<title>USA: Carmax Group and Circuit City Group results.</title>
<headline>Carmax Group and Circuit City Group results.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Circuit City Stores Inc. on Monday released the third quarter and nine-month results for the proposed CarMax Group and Circuit City Group tracking stocks that will be created pending the approval of the CarMax Stock Proposal at the special meeting of shareholders on January 24, 1997.</p>
